{"page":516,"verses":[{"verse_key":"49:5","surah":49,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ أَنَّهُمْ صَبَرُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ تَخْرُجَ إِلَيْهِمْ لَكَانَ خَيْرًا لَّهُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It would have been better for them if they had waited patiently for you to come out to them but God is all forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"صَبَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"had been patient","transliteration":"ṣabarū","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَخْرُجَ","en_gloss":"you came out","transliteration":"takhruja","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhim","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَكَانَ","en_gloss":"certainly it would be","transliteration":"lakāna","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"49:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"49:5"}]},{"verse_key":"49:6","surah":49,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِن جَآءَكُمْ فَاسِقٌۢ بِنَبَإٍ فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟ أَن تُصِيبُوا۟ قَوْمًۢا بِجَهَـٰلَةٍ فَتُصْبِحُوا۟ عَلَىٰ مَا فَعَلْتُمْ نَـٰدِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, if a troublemaker brings you news, check it first, in case you wrong others unwittingly and later regret what you have done,","word