ransliteration":"","verse_key":"49:9"}]},{"verse_key":"49:10","surah":49,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ إِخْوَةٌ فَأَصْلِحُوا۟ بَيْنَ أَخَوَيْكُمْ ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The believers are brothers, so make peace between your two brothers and be mindful of God, so that you may be given mercy.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minūna","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِخْوَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) brothers","transliteration":"ikh'watun","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَأَصْلِحُوا۟","en_gloss":"so make peace","transliteration":"fa-aṣliḥū","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَخَوَيْكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your brothers","transliteration":"akhawaykum","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fear Allah","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"and fear Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"تُرْحَمُونَ","en_gloss":"receive mercy","transliteration":"tur'ḥamūna","verse_key":"49:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"49:10"}]},{"verse_key":"49:11","surah":49,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لَا يَسْخَرْ قَوْمٌ مِّن قَوْمٍ عَسَىٰٓ أَن يَكُونُوا۟ خَيْرًا مِّنْهُمْ وَلَا نِسَآءٌ مِّن نِّسَآءٍ عَسَىٰٓ أَن يَكُنَّ خَيْرًا مِّنْهُنَّ ۖ وَلَا تَلْمِزُوٓا۟ أَنفُسَكُمْ وَلَا تَنَابَزُوا۟ بِٱلْأَلْقَـٰبِ ۖ بِئْسَ ٱلِٱسْمُ ٱلْفُسُوقُ بَعْدَ ٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ ۚ وَمَن لَّمْ يَتُبْ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Believers, no one group of men should jeer at another, who may after all be better than them; no one group of women should jeer at another, who may after all be better than them; do not speak ill of one another; do not use offensive nicknames for one another. How bad it is to be called a mischief-maker after accepting faith! Those who do not repent of this behaviour are evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Let) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَسْخَرْ","en_gloss":"ridicule","transliteration":"yaskhar","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَوْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawmun","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَوْمٍ","en_gloss":"(another) people","transliteration":"qawmin","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"perhaps","transliteration":"ʿasā","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"they may be","transliteration":"yakūnū","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَيْرًۭا","en_gloss":"better","transliteration":"khayran","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"than them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (let) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نِسَآءٌۭ","en_gloss":"women","transliteration":"nisāon","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":17,"ar":"نِّسَآءٍ","en_gloss":"(other) women","transliteration":"nisāin","verse_key":"49:11"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"perha